1
00:00:22,120 --> 00:00:24,920
The ultimate harem

2
00:00:27,020 --> 00:00:30,980
Lightly leaping over these hectic times

3
00:00:33,180 --> 00:00:37,440
Diving into the city,
playing at being a hero

4
00:00:37,440 --> 00:00:39,380
I wanna spend time with you forever

5
00:00:39,380 --> 00:00:42,160
Only trendy things

6
00:00:42,160 --> 00:00:45,080
Like things you keep wearing

7
00:00:45,080 --> 00:00:49,220
Because your bare face is the
one that sells out on the spot

8
00:00:49,220 --> 00:00:50,880
Let it rain

9
00:00:50,880 --> 00:00:55,000
Everybody can do, we've started running

10
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:58,240
Dreams never stop, you know

11
00:00:58,240 --> 00:01:02,500
Let's set sail again tomorrow

12
00:01:02,500 --> 00:01:03,280
Let it run

13
00:01:03,860 --> 00:01:07,680
Everybody can do, just a little

14
00:01:07,680 --> 00:01:10,820
Even if we stick out, it doesn't hurt

15
00:01:10,820 --> 00:01:15,000
Holding onto restless curiosity

16
00:01:15,660 --> 00:01:18,060
Stronger, higher, straight ahead

17
